@babakks Thanks for confirming that disabling metadata signature verification is expected! I am able to install gh with the verification turned off.
A quick question regarding https://cli.github.com/packages/rpm/gh-cli.repo, when inspecting that .repo file I don't see repo-gpgcheck=0 specified in that file. I would have expected to see that in there given the recommened file disables the verification check. I believe I'm following the recommended steps as outlined for dnf.
Appreciate the fast reply and apologize for the late response.
